# app3d/WalkerCamera — the walker examples' camera (136, 137, 143): the rig,
# the camera, the scene light and the Hosek sky data (WalkerCamera), the rig
# as an ECS parent relation in the WalkerWorld (rig entity -> camera entity),
# and cameraUpdate: the camera bar, the touch stick, the rig's input, the GAME
# camera turning after the walker and staying above the terrain. It returns a
# CameraTick, because the touch stick's state feeds the character's movement
# and the camera-moved flag the render decision.
